<DIRECTIONS NORTH EAST WEST SOUTH NE NW SE SW UP DOWN IN OUT LAND>
<GLOBAL ON-LOAN <>>
<GLOBAL WIDE-LOAN <>>
<GLOBAL RECEIPT-READ <>>
<GLOBAL BOARD-READ <>>
<ROOM LENDING (DESC "Lending Hall") (IN ROOMS) (FLAGS RLANDBIT ONBIT)
 (EAST TO FOLDING) (NORTH TO BASIN) (ACTION LENDING-F)>
<ROOM FOLDING (DESC "Folding Room") (IN ROOMS) (FLAGS RLANDBIT ONBIT)
 (WEST TO LENDING) (NORTH TO TERRACE) (ACTION FOLDING-F)>
<ROOM BASIN (DESC "Dry Basin") (IN ROOMS) (FLAGS RLANDBIT ONBIT)
 (SOUTH TO LENDING) (EAST TO TERRACE) (ACTION BASIN-F)>
<ROOM TERRACE (DESC "Reading Terrace") (IN ROOMS) (FLAGS RLANDBIT ONBIT)
 (SOUTH TO FOLDING) (WEST TO BASIN) (ACTION TERRACE-F)>


<OBJECT CASE (IN LENDING) (DESC "lending cabinet") (SYNONYM CABINET CASE CUPBOARD)
 (ADJECTIVE LENDING GLASS)
 (FLAGS NDESCBIT CONTBIT SEARCHBIT) (CAPACITY 20)
 (ACTION CASE-F)>

<OBJECT LEAF (IN CASE) (DESC "tomorrow leaf") (SYNONYM LEAF PAGE PAPER SHEET)
 (ADJECTIVE TOMORROW TINY GOLD SHARED WIDE)
 (FLAGS TAKEBIT READBIT TRYTAKEBIT) (SIZE 5)
 (INTERACTIONS "PUT:CASE,BOARD,FRAME;PUT-ON:BOARD,FRAME") (ACTION LEAF-F)>

<OBJECT BOARD (IN FOLDING) (DESC "folding board") (SYNONYM BOARD TABLE GUIDE)
 (ADJECTIVE FOLDING WOODEN)
 (FLAGS NDESCBIT READBIT CONTBIT SEARCHBIT OPENBIT SURFACEBIT) (CAPACITY 20)
 (INTERACTIONS "read") (ACTION BOARD-F)>

<OBJECT RECEIPT (IN BASIN) (DESC "loan receipt") (SYNONYM RECEIPT SLIP)
 (ADJECTIVE LOAN OLD)
 (FLAGS NDESCBIT READBIT) (INTERACTIONS "read") (ACTION RECEIPT-F)>

<OBJECT RILL (IN BASIN) (DESC "stone trough") (SYNONYM TROUGH BASIN RILL)
 (ADJECTIVE STONE DRY)
 (FLAGS NDESCBIT) (INTERACTIONS "listen") (ACTION RILL-F)>

<OBJECT FRAME (IN TERRACE) (DESC "reading frame") (SYNONYM FRAME STAND)
 (ADJECTIVE READING EMPTY BRASS)
 (FLAGS NDESCBIT CONTBIT SEARCHBIT OPENBIT READBIT SURFACEBIT) (CAPACITY 20)
 (INTERACTIONS "read") (ACTION FRAME-F)>

;"End of world data."
